&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;姓名：&lt;/strong&gt;Alias Iuris，简称AI，正常情况下以及非正式称呼中称呼为郗炙， &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;AI酱&lt;/span&gt;，字修&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iuris&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3265964&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607305792&quot; alt=&quot;Iuris&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3265964)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iuris&quot;  &gt;Iuris&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
